{"3632570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gut Eater", "steam_appid": 3632570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632570/extras/6cb329524552c32b21070724c1120031.poster.avif?t=1750417276\" width=730 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632570/extras/6cb329524552c32b21070724c1120031.webm?t=1750417276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632570/extras/6cb329524552c32b21070724c1120031.mp4?t=1750417276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>&quot;Wishlist &amp; follow if you're curious 👁️ — it helps a <i>lot</i> to spread the word!&quot;</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 <strong>Gut Eater</strong> – A psychological horror experience where your only mission is to take care of a cat... unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 A mysterious package. Inside, a creature that stares at you, tests you… and waits. It’s no ordinary pet — it’s a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍖 Feed him. Entertain him. Touch him. Survive. But the more you play, the deeper he slips into your mind… and your reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 😨 An oppressive game: he knows when you hesitate, he knows when you're afraid.<br>🔹 🧠 Horror that breaks the screen: what if your nightmare became real?<br>🔹 👁️ A constant sense of unease: are you playing… or being played?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚪 You’re locked in with him. And he’s hungry. 🤮🍽️🫀<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632570/extras/ffba01236adfc8f18594e1ab39393025.avif?t=1750417276\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic